      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Extract LinkedIn Company Employees & Decision-Makers to HubSpot (No Cookies)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAutomatically pull VP, Director, and C-Level decision-makers from target companies on LinkedIn (100% cookie-free) and push leads to HubSpot, Clay, or Slack.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-company-employees-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-company-employees-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Company Employees & People Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
